#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore mypath  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore mypath  */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi paket\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami sarankan memakai versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang ditingkatkan, dan fiturnya berubah dengan cepat.** Selama fase pengembangan ini, temukan catatan rilis dan dokumentasi terbaru di halaman [GitHub Qiskit Serverless](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example demonstrates how to use `qiskit-serverless` tools to create a parallel transpilation program, and then implement `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to upload your program to IBM Quantum Platform to use as a reusable remote service.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan alat `qiskit-serverless` untuk membuat program transpilasi paralel, lalu mengimplementasikan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk mengunggah programmu ke IBM Quantum Platform agar bisa digunakan sebagai layanan remote yang bisa dipakai ulang.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow overview {#workflow-overview}"
msgstr "Ringkasan alur kerja {#workflow-overview}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a local directory and empty program file (`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"
msgstr "Buat direktori lokal dan file program kosong (`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to your program that, when uploaded to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a circuit\n"
msgstr "Tambahkan kode ke programmu yang, saat diunggah ke Qiskit Serverless, akan mentranspilasi sebuah circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk autentikasi ke Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the program to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Unggah program ke Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After uploading your program , you can run it to transpile the circuit by following the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload) guide.\n"
msgstr "Setelah mengunggah programmu, kamu bisa menjalankannya untuk mentranspilasi circuit dengan mengikuti panduan [Jalankan workload Qiskit Serverless pertamamu secara remote](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Remote transpilation with Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Contoh: transpilasi remote dengan Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example walks you through creating and adding to a program file that, when you upload it to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a `circuit` against a given `backend` and target `optimization_level`.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini memandumu membuat dan menambahkan ke sebuah file program yang, saat kamu unggah ke Qiskit Serverless, akan mentranspilasi sebuah `circuit` terhadap `backend` dan `optimization_level` target yang diberikan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless requires setting up your workload’s `.py` files into a dedicated directory. The following structure is an example of good practice:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Serverless mengharuskan pengaturan file `.py` workload-mu ke dalam direktori tersendiri. Struktur berikut adalah contoh praktik yang baik:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Serverless uploads the contents of a specific directory (in this example, the `source_files` directory) to run remotely. After these are set up, you can adjust `transpile_remote.py` to fetch inputs and return outputs.\n"
msgstr "Serverless mengunggah isi direktori tertentu (dalam contoh ini, direktori `source_files`) untuk dijalankan secara remote. Setelah semuanya siap, kamu bisa menyesuaikan `transpile_remote.py` untuk mengambil input dan mengembalikan output.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the directory and an empty program file {#create-the-directory-and-an-empty-program-file}"
msgstr "Buat direktori dan file program kosong {#create-the-directory-and-an-empty-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a directory named `source_files`, then create a program file in the directory, so that its path is `./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. This is the file you will upload to Qiskit Serverless.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, buat direktori bernama `source_files`, lalu buat file program di dalam direktori tersebut, sehingga path-nya adalah `./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. Ini adalah file yang akan kamu unggah ke Qiskit Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to your program file {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"
msgstr "Tambahkan kode ke file program-mu {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Populate your program file with the following code, then save it.\n"
msgstr "Isi file program-mu dengan kode berikut, lalu simpan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"If you're reading the code cells locally in a notebook, you will see the `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Executing cells with this magic command saves them to disk rather than executing them.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Jika kamu membaca cell kode secara lokal di sebuah notebook, kamu akan melihat [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile) `%%writefile`. Menjalankan cell dengan magic command ini menyimpannya ke disk, bukan menjalankannya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to get program arguments {#add-code-to-get-program-arguments}"
msgstr "Tambahkan kode untuk mengambil argumen program {#add-code-to-get-program-arguments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now add the following code to your program file, which sets up program arguments.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang tambahkan kode berikut ke file program-mu, yang menyiapkan argumen program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your initial `transpile_remote.py` has three inputs: `circuits`, `backend_name`, and `optimization_level`. Serverless is currently limited to only accept serializable inputs and outputs. For this reason, you cannot pass in `backend` directly, so use `backend_name` as a string instead.\n"
msgstr "`transpile_remote.py` awalmu punya tiga input: `circuits`, `backend_name`, dan `optimization_level`. Serverless saat ini hanya bisa menerima input dan output yang bisa diserialisasi. Karena itu, kamu tidak bisa langsung memasukkan `backend`, jadi gunakan `backend_name` sebagai string.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code that calls the backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"
msgstr "Tambahkan kode yang memanggil backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the following code to your program file, which calls your backend with `QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"
msgstr "Tambahkan kode berikut ke file program-mu, yang memanggil backend-mu dengan `QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following code assumes that you have already followed the process to save your credentials by using `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, and will load your default saved account unless you specify otherwise. See [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials) and [Initialize your IBM Quantum Compute Service account](/guides/initialize-account) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Kode berikut mengasumsikan kamu sudah mengikuti proses untuk menyimpan kredensialmu menggunakan `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, dan akan memuat akun tersimpan default-mu kecuali kamu menentukan lain. Lihat [Simpan kredensial login-mu](/guides/save-credentials) dan [Inisialisasi akun IBM Quantum Compute Service-mu](/guides/initialize-account) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to transpile {#add-code-to-transpile}"
msgstr "Tambahkan kode untuk mentranspilasi {#add-code-to-transpile}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, add the following code to your program file. This code runs `transpile_remote()` across all `circuits` passed in, and returns the `transpiled_circuits` as a result:\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, tambahkan kode berikut ke file program-mu. Kode ini menjalankan `transpile_remote()` untuk semua `circuits` yang dimasukkan, dan mengembalikan `transpiled_circuits` sebagai hasilnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Autentikasi ke Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to `QiskitServerless` with your API key (you can use your `QiskitRuntimeService` API key, or create a new API key on the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk autentikasi ke `QiskitServerless` dengan API key-mu (kamu bisa memakai API key `QiskitRuntimeService`-mu, atau membuat API key baru di [dashboard IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run code to upload {#run-code-to-upload}"
msgstr "Jalankan kode untuk mengunggah {#run-code-to-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the following code to upload the program. Qiskit Serverless compresses the contents of `working_dir` (in this case, `source_files`) into a `tar`, which is uploaded and then cleaned up. The `entrypoint` identifies the main program executable for Qiskit Serverless to run.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan kode berikut untuk mengunggah program. Qiskit Serverless mengompres isi `working_dir` (dalam hal ini, `source_files`) menjadi sebuah `tar`, yang diunggah lalu dibersihkan. `entrypoint` mengidentifikasi file program utama yang akan dijalankan oleh Qiskit Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify upload {#verify-upload}"
msgstr "Verifikasi unggahan {#verify-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To check if it successfully uploaded, use `serverless.list()`, as in the following code:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengecek apakah berhasil diunggah, gunakan `serverless.list()`, seperti pada kode berikut:\n"

